  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "最后，按角色各做一件事。",
   "spoken": "最后，按决色各做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.9
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "先对照八个关口问一句，哪一个是你们跳过的？",
   "spoken": "先对照八个关口问一句，哪一个是你们跳过的？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.94,
   "dur": 4.152,
   "speechStart": 5.038,
   "speechEnd": 8.252
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "开发者，今天就给你的核心合约，写下一条不变量，让测试去检查它。",
   "spoken": "开发者，今天就给你的核心合约，写下一条不变量，让测试去检查它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-02.mp3",
   "start": 9.592,
   "dur": 6.312,
   "speechStart": 9.69,
   "speechEnd": 15.082
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "做审计和评审的人，核对审计版本的提交哈希，和线上字节码是不是同一份。",
   "spoken": "做审计和评审的人，核对审计版本的提交哈希，和线上字节码是不是同一份。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.124,
   "dur": 6.936,
   "speechStart": 16.222,
   "speechEnd": 22.233
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "项目负责人，回答一个问题，如果今晚出事，谁有权按下暂停，他自己知道吗？",
   "spoken": "项目负责人，回答一个问题，如果今晚出事，谁有权按下暂停，他自己知道吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-04.mp3",
   "start": 23.28,
   "dur": 7.176,
   "speechStart": 23.378,
   "speechEnd": 29.628
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-05.mp3",
   "start": 30.956,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 31.054,
   "speechEnd": 32.268
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "项目方能用我们通过了审计，证明线上代码安全吗？",
   "spoken": "项目方能用我们通过了审计，证明线上代码安全吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-06.mp3",
   "start": 33.336,
   "dur": 4.464,
   "speechStart": 33.434,
   "speechEnd": 36.969
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "不能。",
   "spoken": "不能。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-07.mp3",
   "start": 38.3,
   "dur": 1.872,
   "speechStart": 38.398,
   "speechEnd": 39.017
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "审计结论，只对审计时的那个提交哈希成立。",
   "spoken": "审计结论，只对审计时的那个提交哈希成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-08.mp3",
   "start": 40.392,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 40.49,
   "speechEnd": 44.371
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "还要证明线上字节码等于审计版本，并且上线后的每一次改动，都经过审查。",
   "spoken": "还要证明线上字节码等于审计版本，并且上线后的每一次改动，都经过审查。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg6-09.mp3",
   "start": 45.436,
   "dur": 7.008,
   "speechStart": 45.534,
   "speechEnd": 51.593
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "审计是流水线上的一个关口，不是一张免检证书。",
